  <main class="main">
    <div class="hero">
      <div class="tag">Design System</div>
      <h1>Carbon Signal</h1>
      <p>The visual language for the Race Telemetry Workbench — a dense, dark motorsport
      analysis surface. It trades the pure-black engineering look of legacy tools for a
      <b style="color:var(--rt-text-primary)">warm graphite</b> base lit by a single
      <b style="color:var(--rt-accent)">signal amber</b> accent, with an original,
      colorblind-safe channel palette so traces, flags, and the replay cursor never compete.</p>
      <div class="chips">
        <span class="chip"><b>Base</b> warm graphite #14110E</span>
        <span class="chip"><b>Accent</b> signal amber #F2A007</span>
        <span class="chip"><b>Channels</b> Okabe-Ito derived</span>
        <span class="chip"><b>Type</b> Inter + JetBrains Mono</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- HOME -->
    <section id="home">
      <div class="sec-head"><h2>Home &amp; launcher</h2>
        <p>The entry surface: pick a circuit, then a session, then drivers. Recent sessions sit up
        top; everything is one keystroke away via the command palette.</p></div>
      <div class="card" style="padding:0;overflow:hidden">
        <div style="padding:20px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rt-border-default);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between">
          <div><div style="font-size:18px;color:var(--rt-text-primary);font-weight:600">Open a session</div>
            <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--rt-text-tertiary);margin-top:2px">Race Telemetry Workbench · 2 seasons imported</div></div>
          <div class="search" style="width:240px"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"/></svg><input class="input" placeholder="Search circuit  ·  press /"></div>
        </div>
        <div style="padding:18px 22px">
          <div class="subhead" style="margin-top:0">Step 1 · Circuit</div>
          <div class="launch" style="margin-bottom:20px">
            <div class="tcard sel"><div class="fl" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg,#0A8A3C 33%,#fff 33% 66%,#E5484D 66%)"></div><div class="nm">Monza</div><div class="mt">2024 · 2025</div></div>
            <div class="tcard"><div class="fl" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg,#E5484D 50%,#fff 50%)"></div><div class="nm">Monaco</div><div class="mt">2025</div></div>
            <div class="tcard"><div class="fl" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#0A8A3C 33%,#fff 33% 66%,#E5484D 66%)"></div><div class="nm">Spa</div><div class="mt">2023</div></div>
            <div class="tcard"><div class="fl" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg,#E5484D 50%,#fff 50%)"></div><div class="nm">Silverstone</div><div class="mt">2024</div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="grid2" style="align-items:start">
            <div>
              <div class="subhead" style="margin-top:0">Step 2 · Session</div>
              <div class="row" style="gap:8px">
                <span class="chchip" style="border-color:var(--rt-accent-border);background:var(--rt-accent-muted);color:var(--rt-text-primary)">Race</span>
                <span class="chchip">Qualifying</span>
                <span class="chchip">Sprint</span>
                <span class="chchip">FP1–3</span>
              </div>
              <div class="row" style="gap:8px;margin-top:10px">
                <span class="badge" style="background:var(--rt-bg-raised);color:var(--rt-text-secondary)">2024 · Italian GP</span>
                <span class="badge" style="background:var(--rt-accent-muted);color:var(--rt-accent)"><span class="led" style="background:#F2A007"></span>2025 · Italian GP</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="subhead" style="margin-top:0">Step 3 · Drivers</div>
              <div class="row" style="gap:8px;align-items:center">
                <span class="dchip on" style="padding:5px 10px"><span class="tm" style="background:#56B4E9"></span><span class="nm">LEC</span></span>
                <span class="dchip on" style="padding:5px 10px"><span class="tm" style="background:#E69F00"></span><span class="nm">HAM</span></span>
                <span class="dchip" style="padding:5px 10px"><span class="tm" style="background:#2BB079"></span><span class="nm">NOR</span></span>
                <span class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm">+ 17 more</span>
                <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" style="margin-left:auto"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg>Open replay</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- COMMAND PALETTE -->
    <section id="palette">
      <div class="sec-head"><h2>Command palette</h2>
        <p>A global launcher (<span class="kbd">⌘K</span> / <span class="kbd">/</span>) for jumping to any imported session, driver, or view
        without leaving the keyboard. Fuzzy matches circuits, seasons, and quick actions.</p></div>
      <div class="cmdk-vp">
        <div class="cmdk">
          <div class="cmdk-in"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"/></svg>
            <input value="monza" readonly><span class="kbd">ESC</span></div>
          <div class="cmdk-grp"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M13 2 3 14h7l-1 8 10-12h-7z"/></svg>Sessions</div>
          <div class="cmdk-row on"><span class="fl" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg,#0A8A3C 33%,#fff 33% 66%,#E5484D 66%)"></span><span><span class="nm">2025 Italian Grand Prix</span><br><span class="sub">Monza · Race · full analysis</span></span><span class="go">Open <span class="kbd">↵</span></span></div>
          <div class="cmdk-row"><span class="fl" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg,#0A8A3C 33%,#fff 33% 66%,#E5484D 66%)"></span><span><span class="nm">2024 Italian Grand Prix</span><br><span class="sub">Monza · Race · full analysis</span></span></div>
          <div class="cmdk-grp"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 21c0-4 4-6 8-6s8 2 8 6"/></svg>Quick actions</div>
          <div class="cmdk-row"><span class="fl" style="background:var(--rt-bg-raised)"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--rt-text-tertiary)" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 12h4l3-9 4 18 3-9h4"/></svg></span><span><span class="nm">Compare LEC vs HAM at Monza</span><br><span class="sub">Lap comparison</span></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SESSION SHELL -->
    <section id="shell">
      <div class="sec-head"><h2>Session shell</h2>
        <p>Inside a session, a tab bar switches between analysis views over a shared header and KPI
        stat row. The active tab carries the amber underline.</p></div>
      <div class="card" style="padding:0;overflow:hidden">
        <div style="padding:18px 22px 0">
          <div class="row" style="justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:14px">
            <div><div style="font-size:20px;color:var(--rt-text-primary);font-weight:600">Italian Grand Prix</div>
              <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--rt-text-tertiary);margin-top:2px">2025 season · Race · Monza</div></div>
            <div class="row" style="gap:8px"><button class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm">Export</button><button class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm">Save view</button>
              <select class="select" style="width:auto;padding:6px 10px;font-size:12px"><option>Race</option><option>Qualifying</option></select></div>
          </div>
          <div class="tabs">
            <a>Overview</a><a>Replay</a><a class="on">Strategy</a><a>Lap analysis</a><a>Head to head</a><a>Telemetry</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="padding:18px 22px">
          <div class="statrow">
            <div class="st"><div class="k">Total pit stops</div><div class="v">42</div></div>
            <div class="st"><div class="k">Avg stops</div><div class="v">2.1</div></div>
            <div class="st"><div class="k">Most used</div><div class="v" style="font-size:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:8px"><span style="width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#E6B422"></span>MEDIUM <small>33 stints</small></div></div>
            <div class="st"><div class="k">Race distance</div><div class="v">53 <small>laps</small></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- DRIVER MULTISELECT -->
    <section id="driverselect">
      <div class="sec-head"><h2>Driver multi-select</h2>
        <p>A grid of toggleable driver chips with a team-color rail and a checkbox affordance.
        Select-all / clear and a live count sit in the header; selection is local UI state.</p></div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="row" style="justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:12px">
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--rt-text-secondary)"><b style="color:var(--rt-text-primary)">3</b> of 20 drivers selected</div>
          <div class="row" style="gap:6px"><button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm">Select all</button><button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm">Clear</button></div>
        </div>
        <div class="dsel" id="dsel">
          <span class="dchip on"><span class="box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M5 12l5 5 9-10"/></svg></span><span class="tm" style="background:#56B4E9"></span><span class="nm">Leclerc</span><span class="pos">P3</span></span>
          <span class="dchip on"><span class="box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M5 12l5 5 9-10"/></svg></span><span class="tm" style="background:#E69F00"></span><span class="nm">Hamilton</span><span class="pos">P2</span></span>
          <span class="dchip on"><span class="box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M5 12l5 5 9-10"/></svg></span><span class="tm" style="background:#2BB079"></span><span class="nm">Norris</span><span class="pos">P5</span></span>
          <span class="dchip"><span class="box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M5 12l5 5 9-10"/></svg></span><span class="tm" style="background:#C879B8"></span><span class="nm">Verstappen</span><span class="pos">P1</span></span>
          <span class="dchip"><span class="box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M5 12l5 5 9-10"/></svg></span><span class="tm" style="background:#2BB079"></span><span class="nm">Piastri</span><span class="pos">P4</span></span>
          <span class="dchip"><span class="box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="M5 12l5 5 9-10"/></svg></span><span class="tm" style="background:#57C7C2"></span><span class="nm">Russell</span><span class="pos">P6</span></span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- COLOR -->
    <section id="color">
      <div class="sec-head"><h2>Color</h2>
        <p>Surfaces are warm-tinted graphite, never #000 — depth comes from four stacked layers
        plus borders rather than heavy shadow. Amber is reserved exclusively for primary action,
        selection, focus, and the replay cursor.</p></div>

      <div class="subhead">Surfaces</div>
      <div class="swatches">
        <div class="sw"><div class="chip" style="background:#14110E"></div><div class="meta"><div class="name">canvas</div><div class="hex">#14110E</div><div class="note">app background</div></div></div>
        <div class="sw"><div class="chip" style="background:#1C1815"></div><div class="meta"><div class="name">surface</div><div class="hex">#1C1815</div><div class="note">panels, cards</div></div></div>
        <div class="sw"><div class="chip" style="background:#241F1B"></div><div class="meta"><div class="name">raised</div><div class="hex">#241F1B</div><div class="note">headers, popovers</div></div></div>
        <div class="sw"><div class="chip" style="background:#2C2620"></div><div class="meta"><div class="name">overlay</div><div class="hex">#2C2620</div><div class="note">menus, dialogs</div></div></div>
        <div class="sw"><div class="chip" style="background:#100D0B"></div><div class="meta"><div class="name">inset</div><div class="hex">#100D0B</div><div class="note">plot areas, wells</div></div></div>
        <div class="sw"><div class="chip" style="background:#3A2D12"></div><div class="meta"><div class="name">selected</div><div class="hex">#3A2D12</div><div class="note">amber-tinted row</div></div></div>
      </div>

