        figures keep telemetry columns from shifting as values update during replay.</p></div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="type-row"><div class="meta"><b>Hero readout</b>44px · mono</div><div class="mono" style="font-size:44px;color:var(--rt-text-primary);line-height:1">1:21.456</div></div>
        <div class="type-row"><div class="meta"><b>Numeric lg</b>28px · mono</div><div class="mono" style="font-size:28px;color:var(--rt-text-primary)">298.2 km/h</div></div>
