      <div class="sec-head"><h2>Corner-level performance index</h2>
        <p>Once <code>detect_telemetry_windows</code> attributes braking/throttle zones to corners via
        <code>circuit_markers</code>, each corner becomes a driver-vs-driver comparison: brake point,
        minimum speed, and exit speed deltas — surfaced cleanly per turn. Extends planned Phase 1 corner-matching work.</p></div>
      <div class="grid2" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1.4fr;align-items:start">
        <div class="panel">
          <div class="panel-hd"><div class="t">Turn 1 · Rettifilo</div>
            <span class="mono" style="font-size:11px;color:var(--rt-text-tertiary)">LEC vs HAM</span></div>
          <div class="panel-bd" style="background:var(--rt-bg-inset)">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 260 150" width="100%" style="display:block">
              <path d="M20 130 L120 120 L150 96 L156 70 L150 50" fill="none" stroke="var(--rt-border-strong)" stroke-width="10" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              <path d="M20 130 L120 120 L150 96 L156 70 L150 50" fill="none" stroke="#2A2620" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="1 7" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <circle cx="95" cy="121" r="5" fill="#E69F00" stroke="var(--rt-bg-inset)" stroke-width="2"/>
              <circle cx="113" cy="120" r="5" fill="#56B4E9" stroke="var(--rt-bg-inset)" stroke-width="2"/>
              <line x1="95" y1="121" x2="113" y2="120" stroke="var(--rt-accent)" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="2 2"/>
              <text x="104" y="142" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--rt-font-mono)" font-size="9" fill="var(--rt-accent)">12 m later</text>
              <text x="150" y="44" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--rt-font-mono)" font-size="9" fill="var(--rt-text-tertiary)">apex</text>
            </svg>
            <div class="row" style="justify-content:space-between;margin-top:6px;padding:0 2px">
              <span class="badge" style="background:rgba(86,180,233,.16);color:#56B4E9"><span class="led" style="background:#56B4E9"></span>LEC brake</span>
              <span class="badge" style="background:rgba(230,159,0,.16);color:#E69F00"><span class="led" style="background:#E69F00"></span>HAM brake</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="panel">
          <div class="panel-hd"><div class="t">Corner index</div>
            <span class="mono" style="font-size:11px;color:var(--rt-text-tertiary)">Δ = LEC − HAM</span></div>
          <div class="tbl-wrap" style="border:none;border-radius:0">
            <table class="tbl">
              <thead><tr><th>Corner</th><th>Brake Δm</th><th>Min km/h Δ</th><th>Exit km/h Δ</th><th>Time Δ</th></tr></thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr class="sel"><td class="lbl">T1 Rettifilo</td><td style="color:var(--rt-delta-pos)">+12.0</td><td style="color:var(--rt-delta-pos)">+6.2</td><td style="color:var(--rt-delta-pos)">+3.1</td><td class="fastest">−0.121</td></tr>
                <tr><td class="lbl">T4 Roggia</td><td>+3.1</td><td style="color:var(--rt-delta-neg)">−2.0</td><td>+0.4</td><td style="color:var(--rt-delta-neg)">+0.044</td></tr>
                <tr><td class="lbl">T6 Lesmo</td><td style="color:var(--rt-delta-pos)">+5.5</td><td>+1.1</td><td style="color:var(--rt-delta-pos)">+2.6</td><td style="color:var(--rt-delta-pos)">−0.067</td></tr>
                <tr><td class="lbl">T8 Ascari</td><td style="color:var(--rt-delta-neg)">−4.2</td><td style="color:var(--rt-delta-neg)">−3.4</td><td style="color:var(--rt-delta-neg)">−1.8</td><td style="color:var(--rt-delta-neg)">+0.092</td></tr>
                <tr><td class="lbl">T11 Parabolica</td><td style="color:var(--rt-delta-pos)">+8.7</td><td style="color:var(--rt-delta-pos)">+4.0</td><td style="color:var(--rt-delta-pos)">+5.2</td><td class="fastest">−0.158</td></tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SESSION DIFF -->
    <section id="sessiondiff">
      <div class="sec-head"><h2>Session diff · multi-season</h2>
        <p>§8.6 defers cross-session comparison; this is the natural extension of the existing
        <code>compare/laps</code> contract — the same driver’s best lap at the same circuit across two
        seasons. Both 2024 and 2025 Monza are already imported, so this tracks car/driver development year-over-year.</p></div>
      <div class="panel">
        <div class="panel-hd">
          <div class="t"><span class="ic"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16"/></svg></span>LEC best lap · Monza</div>
          <div class="row" style="gap:6px">
            <span class="badge" style="background:rgba(138,127,112,.18);color:var(--rt-text-secondary)"><span class="led" style="background:#8A7F70"></span>2024</span>
            <span class="badge" style="background:var(--rt-accent-muted);color:var(--rt-accent)"><span class="led" style="background:#F2A007"></span>2025</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-bd" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 230px;gap:0;padding:0">
          <div style="background:var(--rt-bg-inset);position:relative;border-right:1px solid var(--rt-border-default)">
            <svg id="diff" viewBox="0 0 460 200" width="100%" preserveAspectRatio="none" style="display:block"></svg>
          </div>
          <div style="padding:14px">
            <div class="note" style="font-size:11px;color:var(--rt-text-tertiary);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em">Lap time Δ</div>
            <div class="mono" style="font-size:30px;color:var(--rt-delta-pos);font-weight:500;line-height:1.1;margin-top:3px">−0.92<span style="font-size:13px;color:var(--rt-text-tertiary)"> s</span></div>
            <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--rt-text-secondary);margin:3px 0 14px">2025 faster — net development gain</div>
            <div class="legend" style="font-size:12px">
              <div class="li" style="grid-template-columns:14px 1fr auto;padding:5px 0"><span class="ln" style="border-color:#8A7F70"></span><span class="nm">2024 best</span><span class="vl">1:20.91</span></div>
              <div class="li" style="grid-template-columns:14px 1fr auto;padding:5px 0"><span class="ln" style="border-color:#F2A007"></span><span class="nm">2025 best</span><span class="vl">1:19.99</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="row" style="margin-top:12px">
              <span class="badge" style="background:var(--rt-success-bg);color:var(--rt-success)">+8.4 km/h top speed</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="note-box" style="margin-top:12px;font-size:12px">Season diff reuses the lap-relative alignment of <code>compare/laps</code> but pins
        circuit identity instead of session, and recolors the pair to a neutral past-year grey against the amber current year — so it never reads as a live driver-vs-driver overlay.</div>
    </section>

    <!-- DEBRIEF EXPORT -->
    <section id="debrief">
      <div class="sec-head"><h2>MCP race debrief export</h2>
        <p>Gives the read-only MCP server a tangible artifact beyond chat: a one-page markdown/PDF
        debrief per session built from race/lap story, weather trend, and race-control endpoints —
        what happened, who gained or lost, and the key incidents.</p></div>
      <div class="grid2" style="grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr;align-items:start">
        <div class="panel">
          <div class="panel-hd">
            <div class="t"><span class="ic"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 2h9l5 5v15H6z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6"/></svg></span>debrief · 2024 Monza R</div>
            <div class="row" style="gap:6px">
              <button class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm">.md</button>
              <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 3v12m0 0l-4-4m4 4l4-4M5 21h14"/></svg>Export PDF</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="panel-bd" style="background:var(--rt-bg-canvas)">
            <div style="background:var(--rt-bg-surface);border:1px solid var(--rt-border-subtle);border-radius:var(--rt-radius-md);padding:18px 20px;max-width:520px">
              <div style="font-size:17px;color:var(--rt-text-primary);font-weight:600">Italian Grand Prix — race debrief</div>
              <div class="mono" style="font-size:11px;color:var(--rt-text-tertiary);margin:2px 0 14px">2024-monza-r · 20 drivers · 53 laps · dry, 32–34 °C air</div>
              <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--rt-accent);font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;margin-bottom:5px">What happened</div>
              <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--rt-text-secondary);line-height:1.55;margin-bottom:12px">A one-stop strategy decided the race. The decisive move was an early medium-to-hard
                undercut that flipped track position before the field settled into tyre management.</div>
              <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--rt-accent);font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;margin-bottom:5px">Gained / lost</div>
              <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;margin-bottom:12px">
                <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px"><span style="color:var(--rt-text-secondary)">Largest net gain</span><span class="mono" style="color:var(--rt-delta-pos)">LEC +3 pos</span></div>
                <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px"><span style="color:var(--rt-text-secondary)">Largest net loss</span><span class="mono" style="color:var(--rt-delta-neg)">PIA −2 pos</span></div>
              </div>
              <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--rt-accent);font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;margin-bottom:6px">Key incidents</div>
              <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px">
                <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:34px 14px 1fr;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-size:12px"><span class="mono" style="color:var(--rt-text-tertiary)">L8</span><span class="ev-dot" style="width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#FF9F45"></span><span style="color:var(--rt-text-secondary)">Safety car — debris at T1</span></div>
                <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:34px 14px 1fr;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-size:12px"><span class="mono" style="color:var(--rt-text-tertiary)">L38</span><span style="width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#E5484D"></span><span style="color:var(--rt-text-secondary)">Brief red flag — barrier repair</span></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stack">
          <div class="card" style="padding:16px">
            <div class="subhead" style="margin-top:0">Source endpoints</div>
            <div class="legend" style="font-size:12px">
              <div class="li" style="grid-template-columns:1fr auto;padding:5px 0"><span class="nm">race / lap story</span><span class="badge" style="background:var(--rt-success-bg);color:var(--rt-success);font-size:10px">ready</span></div>
              <div class="li" style="grid-template-columns:1fr auto;padding:5px 0"><span class="nm">session weather summary</span><span class="badge" style="background:var(--rt-success-bg);color:var(--rt-success);font-size:10px">ready</span></div>
              <div class="li" style="grid-template-columns:1fr auto;padding:5px 0"><span class="nm">race-control index</span><span class="badge" style="background:var(--rt-success-bg);color:var(--rt-success);font-size:10px">ready</span></div>
              <div class="li" style="grid-template-columns:1fr auto;padding:5px 0"><span class="nm">stint analysis</span><span class="badge" style="background:var(--rt-success-bg);color:var(--rt-success);font-size:10px">ready</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="note-box" style="font-size:12px">The debrief is pure composition over bounded aggregates — no raw telemetry — so it
            stays inside the read-only MCP contract while producing a shareable file.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- A11Y -->
    <section id="a11y">
      <div class="sec-head"><h2>Accessibility &amp; principles</h2></div>
      <div class="note-box" style="margin-bottom:18px">
        <b>Density with legibility.</b> This is a workbench: every panel describes the same replay
        timestamp. Color, dash redundancy, and tabular numerics let a user read six channels at a
        glance without the UI shouting.
      </div>
      <div class="dodont">
        <div class="col do">
          <h4>Do</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Reserve amber for one primary action, selection, focus, and the cursor.</li>
            <li>Pair every channel hue with its dash pattern so lines survive grayscale.</li>
            <li>Use mono tabular figures for all telemetry so columns never jump.</li>
            <li>Encode delta sign with green/red <em>and</em> a leading + / − glyph.</li>
            <li>Keep body text on surfaces above 7:1 contrast; ticks above 4.5:1.</li>
            <li>Offer a reduced-motion mode that freezes non-essential transitions.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="col dont">
          <h4>Don't</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Paint telemetry traces amber — it collides with the cursor.</li>
            <li>Rely on hue alone to separate driver A from driver B.</li>
            <li>Animate the replay render loop with CSS transitions — it's real-time.</li>
            <li>Use pure black surfaces; the warm graphite base is the brand.</li>
            <li>Stack more than one amber primary button in a single view.</li>
            <li>Interpolate weather like high-frequency data — show nearest/stepped.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
</div>

<script>
// segmented control + channel toggles (chrome interactions only)
document.querySelectorAll('.seg').forEach(function(seg){
  seg.addEventListener('click',function(e){
    var b=e.target.closest('button'); if(!b)return;
    seg.querySelectorAll('button').forEach(function(x){x.setAttribute('aria-pressed','false')});
    b.setAttribute('aria-pressed','true');
  });
});
document.querySelectorAll('.chchip').forEach(function(c){
  c.addEventListener('click',function(){c.classList.toggle('off')});
});

// helpers to build smooth-ish polylines
function noisy(n,base,amp,seed){var pts=[];var x=seed||1;for(var i=0;i<n;i++){x=(x*9301+49297)%233280;var r=x/233280;pts.push(base+Math.sin(i/3.2)*amp*0.6+amp*0.4*(r-0.5));}return pts;}
function pathFrom(vals,w,h,min,max){var n=vals.length;var s='';for(var i=0;i<n;i++){var X=(i/(n-1))*w;var Y=h-((vals[i]-min)/(max-min))*h;s+=(i?'L':'M')+X.toFixed(1)+' '+Y.toFixed(1)+' ';}return s;}

// ---- waveform panel ----
(function(){
  var svg=document.getElementById('wave'); if(!svg)return;
  var W=600,H=240;
  var ns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg';
  function el(t,a){var e=document.createElementNS(ns,t);for(var k in a)e.setAttribute(k,a[k]);return e;}
  // safety-car shade band
  svg.appendChild(el('rect',{x:0.30*W,y:0,width:0.16*W,height:H,fill:'rgba(255,159,69,0.10)'}));
  // gridlines
  for(var g=1;g<5;g++){svg.appendChild(el('line',{x1:0,y1:g*H/5,x2:W,y2:g*H/5,class:'gl'}));}
  // lap boundaries
  [0.18,0.52,0.86].forEach(function(p){svg.appendChild(el('line',{x1:p*W,y1:0,x2:p*W,y2:H,stroke:'#3A342C','stroke-width':1,'stroke-dasharray':'2 3'}));});
  // speed trace (big sweeping)
  var speed=[];for(var i=0;i<120;i++){var ph=i/120*Math.PI*6;speed.push(150+90*Math.abs(Math.sin(ph))-30*Math.sin(ph*0.5));}
  svg.appendChild(el('path',{d:pathFrom(speed,W,H,40,260),fill:'none',stroke:'#56B4E9','stroke-width':1.6,'vector-effect':'non-scaling-stroke'}));
  // brake trace (spiky low)
  var brake=[];for(var j=0;j<120;j++){var b=(Math.sin(j/120*Math.PI*6)<-0.3)?70:6;brake.push(b+(Math.random()*4));}
  svg.appendChild(el('path',{d:pathFrom(brake,W,H,0,100),fill:'none',stroke:'#E06C2A','stroke-width':1.4,'vector-effect':'non-scaling-stroke'}));
  // gear (stepped, dashed)
  var gp='';for(var k=0;k<120;k++){var gx=k/119*W;var gv=3+Math.round(2.5+2.5*Math.sin(k/120*Math.PI*6));var gy=H-(gv/8)*H*0.5-H*0.1;gp+=(k?'L'+gx.toFixed(1)+' '+gy.toFixed(1)+' ':'M'+gx.toFixed(1)+' '+gy.toFixed(1)+' ');}
  svg.appendChild(el('path',{d:gp,fill:'none',stroke:'#C879B8','stroke-width':1.2,'stroke-dasharray':'4 3','vector-effect':'non-scaling-stroke',opacity:0.85}));
  // reference cursor (cool)
  svg.appendChild(el('line',{x1:0.30*W,y1:0,x2:0.30*W,y2:H,stroke:'#7FA6C9','stroke-width':1,'stroke-dasharray':'3 3'}));
  // primary cursor (amber)
  svg.appendChild(el('line',{x1:0.41*W,y1:0,x2:0.41*W,y2:H,stroke:'#F2A007','stroke-width':1.5}));
  svg.appendChild(el('circle',{cx:0.41*W,cy:H*0.32,r:3,fill:'#F2A007'}));
})();

// ---- comparison chart ----
(function(){
  var svg=document.getElementById('cmp'); if(!svg)return;
  var W=440,H=180,ns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg';
  function el(t,a){var e=document.createElementNS(ns,t);for(var k in a)e.setAttribute(k,a[k]);return e;}
  for(var g=1;g<4;g++){svg.appendChild(el('line',{x1:0,y1:g*H/4,x2:W,y2:g*H/4,class:'gl'}));}
  // sector dividers
  [0.34,0.67].forEach(function(p){svg.appendChild(el('line',{x1:p*W,y1:0,x2:p*W,y2:H,stroke:'#3A342C','stroke-width':1}));});
  var a=[],b=[];for(var i=0;i<100;i++){var ph=i/100*Math.PI*5;a.push(150+85*Math.abs(Math.sin(ph)));b.push(150+85*Math.abs(Math.sin(ph+0.18))-6);}
  // delta band between
  svg.appendChild(el('path',{d:pathFrom(a,W,H,40,250)+'L'+W+' '+H+' L0 '+H+' Z',fill:'rgba(242,160,7,0.06)',stroke:'none'}));
  svg.appendChild(el('path',{d:pathFrom(b,W,H,40,250),fill:'none',stroke:'#E69F00','stroke-width':1.5,'vector-effect':'non-scaling-stroke'}));
  svg.appendChild(el('path',{d:pathFrom(a,W,H,40,250),fill:'none',stroke:'#56B4E9','stroke-width':1.5,'vector-effect':'non-scaling-stroke'}));
  svg.appendChild(el('line',{x1:0.47*W,y1:0,x2:0.47*W,y2:H,stroke:'#F2A007','stroke-width':1.5}));
})();

// ---- session diff overlay (2024 grey vs 2025 amber) ----
(function(){
  var svg=document.getElementById('diff'); if(!svg)return;
  var W=460,H=200,ns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg';
  function el(t,a){var e=document.createElementNS(ns,t);for(var k in a)e.setAttribute(k,a[k]);return e;}
  for(var g=1;g<4;g++){svg.appendChild(el('line',{x1:0,y1:g*H/4,x2:W,y2:g*H/4,class:'gl'}));}
  var y24=[],y25=[];for(var i=0;i<110;i++){var ph=i/110*Math.PI*5;var base=150+88*Math.abs(Math.sin(ph));y24.push(base-4);y25.push(base+ (i>55?6:2));}
  svg.appendChild(el('path',{d:pathFrom(y24,W,H,40,260),fill:'none',stroke:'#8A7F70','stroke-width':1.4,'vector-effect':'non-scaling-stroke'}));
  svg.appendChild(el('path',{d:pathFrom(y25,W,H,40,260),fill:'none',stroke:'#F2A007','stroke-width':1.6,'vector-effect':'non-scaling-stroke'}));
  svg.appendChild(el('line',{x1:0.6*W,y1:0,x2:0.6*W,y2:H,stroke:'#7FA6C9','stroke-width':1,'stroke-dasharray':'3 3'}));
})();
</script>
